ick=\"bcv(11,22,52)\">1Kgs 22:52</ref>, <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֶשׂ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,1)\">2Kgs 16:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>שִׁבְעָה עָשָׂר</bdbheb> (that is <bdbheb>הַגּוֺרָל</bdbheb> <highlight>lot</highlight>) <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,15)\">1Chr 24:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,24)\">1Chr 25:24</ref> (compare also, + other number, <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,11)\">1Chr 7:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:30\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,30)\">Ezra 2:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:42\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,42)\">Neh 7:42</ref>), + <bdbheb>יוֺם</bdbheb> 17th day <ref ref=\"Gen 7:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,11)\">Gen 7:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 8:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,4)\">Gen 8:4</ref> unusual is <bdbheb>שְׁקָלִים וַעֲשָׂרָה הַכֶּסֶף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 32:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,9)\">Jer 32:9</ref> <highlight>7 shekels and 10 the silver</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>שְׁבַע מֵאוֺת</bdbheb> = 700 <ref ref=\"Judg 8:26\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,26)\">Judg 8:26</ref> + 39 t. (but <ref ref=\"Neh 7:68\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"68\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"68\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,68)\">Neh 7:68</ref> omitted by Masora <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Gi</lookup> q. v.). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>שִׁבְעָה אֶלֶף</bdbheb> = 7000 <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,30)\">1Kgs 20:30</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>שִׁבְעַת אֲלָפִים</bdbheb> = <highlight>id.</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,15)\">1Kgs 20:15</ref>+ 15 t.; 57,000 is 7 + 50 x 1000 <ref ref=\"Num 1:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,31)\">Num 1:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,8)\">Num 2:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,31)\">Num 2:31</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> + other number: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> follows 18 t.: (1) singular noun after <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,14)\">Judg 8:14</ref> also (= ordinal number) <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,17)\">Ezek 29:17</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>שְׁנַת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁלשִׁים וָשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,10)\">2Kgs 13:10</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,1)\">2Kgs 15:1</ref> (2) plural noun before other number <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:35\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,35)\">Ezra 8:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,1)\">Neh 7:1</ref>:[72]; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:71\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"71\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"71\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,71)\">Neh 7:71</ref> (3) singular noun construct precedes <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת עֶשְׂרִים וָשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,10)\">1Kgs 16:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,15)\">1Kgs 16:15</ref> (ordinal); (4) noun after each number <ref ref=\"Gen 23:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,1)\">Gen 23:1</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Gen 23:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,25)\">Gen 23:25</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), etc. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> precedes 10 t. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and Esther): (1) noun singular after other number <ref ref=\"Gen 8:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,14)\">Gen 8:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 6:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,16)\">Exod 6:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 6:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,20)\">Exod 6:20</ref> + 3 t. Esther; (2) noun repeated <ref ref=\"Gen 5:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,7)\">Gen 5:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,21)\">Gen 11:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,28)\">Gen 47:28</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Gen 5:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,25)\">Gen 5:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 5:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,31)\">Gen 5:31</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> 1000 + 17 <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:39\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,39)\">Ezra 2:39</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:42\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,42)\">Neh 7:42</ref> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> often with sacred significance: <ref ref=\"Gen 21:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,28)\">Gen 21:28</ref>ff. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 37:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,23)\">Exod 37:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,6)\">Lev 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,17)\">Lev 4:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,11)\">Lev 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:27\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,27)\">Lev 14:27</ref> + (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); as round number <ref ref=\"Gen 4:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,24)\">Gen 4:24</ref> (song in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 29:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,18)\">Gen 29:18</ref>ff; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,23)\">Gen 31:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 41:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,2)\">Gen 41:2</ref>ff (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), etc.; on bowing 7 t. <ref ref=\"Gen 33:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,3)\">Gen 33:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; in great humility), compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>TelAm. nos. 143, 230, 246</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nes')\">Ne<sup>Mar,11 f.</sup></lookup>; all these probably originating with week of seven days; compare especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>Hast. DB NUMBER, 562 f.</sup></lookup>, 565. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 41:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Gen 5:26", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "1Kgs 14:21", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 14, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Gen 4:24", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Gen 7:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 7, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "2Sam 21:9", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Gen 21:28", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 21, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Judg 16:13", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 16, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 4:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 4, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 29:18", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 29, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "2Sam 24:13", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 24, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Chr 21:12", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 21, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Gen 33:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 33, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Lev 4:6", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Kgs 6:6", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 6, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 40:20", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 40, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Ezek 40:26", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 40, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Job 5:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 5, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Prov 6:16", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Lev 26:18", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Lev 26:21", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Lev 26:24", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Lev 26:28", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ps 119:64", "book": 